sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Cfg as Remote config (Ch 41/87)
    participant Flow as OnboardingFlow
    participant State as State store (Ch 4)
    participant An as Analytics (Ch 14)

    Cfg-->>Flow: flow definition + A/B variant
    loop each step
        Flow->>State: completed(stepId)?
        alt not completed
            Flow->>User: show step (intro/interests/prime)
            Flow->>An: log step_shown (variant)
            User->>Flow: complete or skip
            Flow->>State: markComplete(stepId) -> persist + sync (Ch 4/32)
            Flow->>An: log step_completed/skipped -> funnel
        else completed
            Flow->>Flow: skip (never re-show)
        end
    end
    An-->>Cfg: funnel + variant outcomes (Ch 87)
